  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a1wrxrK.png\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">史诗战斗 x ParCool! 协作模组！</h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T-uMmLCYbn4?si=7SqKpApwtJMklmNF\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></em></span></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗 (Epic Fight)</a></strong> 是一个高级动画库，而 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/parcool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ParCool!</a></strong> 则增加了动态的玩家移动选项。如果这两个富有创意的项目在《我的世界》世界中相遇……会发生什么？</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CWsUfxt.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>动画效果</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n  <p>首先，你需要启用<strong>战斗模式</strong>以激活基于<strong>史诗战斗的动画</strong>（默认切换键为 R）。</p>\n\n  <h4><strong>ParCool 原始动作</strong></h4>\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>疾跑</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pcD9Nql.gif\" alt=\"疾跑\" width=\"200\" height=\"225\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>猫扑</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p02y9o2.gif\" alt=\"猫扑\" width=\"201\" height=\"226\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>翻滚</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2iclAMJ.gif\" alt=\"翻滚\" width=\"199\" height=\"178\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>抓墙/攀爬</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tN8ZuxC.gif\" alt=\"抓墙与攀爬\" width=\"201\" height=\"208\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>翻越</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2qE05UQ.gif\" alt=\"翻越\" width=\"204\" height=\"237\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>俯冲 &amp; 空中俯冲</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3hL1NyX.gif\" alt=\"俯冲与空中俯冲\" width=\"205\" height=\"235\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p><em>在游戏中发现更多动画！</em></p>\n\n  <h4><strong>基于 ParCool 但独特的动作（仅在战斗模式下有效）</strong></h4>\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>连招移动</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DgW7RVu.gif\" alt=\"连招移动\" width=\"212\" height=\"289\">\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center\">\n      <p>墙面移动</p>\n      <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qAVatkM.gif\" alt=\"墙面移动\" width=\"213\" height=\"198\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p>此插件需要同时安装 <strong>Epic Fight</strong> 和 <strong>ParCool!</strong>。版本号请参阅文件描述。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CWsUfxt.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f1c40f\"><strong>支持与赞助商</strong></span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2724\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kTgYcrh.png\" alt=\"Sparked Host\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CWsUfxt.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Yesssssman/epicfightmod/assets/77132244/7c517b51-581a-48dc-9130-aaad326dbcb4\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">\n  </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fNbAJwj8RHg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Yesssssman/epicfightmod/assets/77132244/f3358cb9-f3cd-46e7-9ed0-a90bc2b1b188\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">\n  </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Yesssssman/epicfightmod/assets/77132244/3f2de855-e926-4eb9-a20c-4c6f44828250\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">\n  </a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fen%252flatest%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://github.com/Yesssssman/epicfightmod/assets/77132244/23220c47-c1e5-4e2b-82aa-876a86d7ed1a\" alt=\"GitHub Docs\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">\n  </a>\n</p>",
